Package: CAPmethods
Type: Package
Title: Covariate-Assisted Principal (CAP) Regression Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-05
Authors@R: person("Yi", "Zhao", email = "zhaoyi1026@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A unified collection of covariate-assisted principal (CAP)
    regression methods for relating subject-level covariates to the
    covariance/heterogeneity structure of multivariate and longitudinal
    outcomes. Includes high-dimensional CAP (HDCAP; with optional covariance
    shrinkage, which also covers the classical CAP model when shrinkage is
    disabled), longitudinal CAP with a time-invariant projection (LCAP),
    multilevel CAP with cluster-varying loadings (MCAP), covariance-on-
    covariance regression (CAP-CoC), CAP mediation, high-dimensional-covariance
    CAP (HDcov/HCAP), and CAP clustering. Computational kernels are implemented
    in C++ via 'RcppArmadillo'.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
